@startuml sequence_line_admission

skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Line Admission (lines mode, each tick)

participant "Simulation" as Sim
participant "TrainState (A->B)" as TA
participant "TrainState (B->A)" as TB
participant "Edge A-B" as E

Sim -> Sim : admitWaiting() before physics
Sim -> E : read numLines
Sim -> TA : waiting, waitSince
Sim -> TB : waiting, waitSince
note over Sim : order by waitSince, then name
Sim -> Sim : pick line empty or same direction\n(fastest, then lowest id)
alt a line is admissible
  Sim -> TA : lineId = L, waiting = false
else every line carries opposite traffic
  Sim -> TB : stays waiting (corridorWaitSec > 0)
  opt Adaptive mode
    Sim -> Sim : considerWaitReroute() once per wait
  end
end
Sim -> Sim : physicsStep() for admitted trains only
@enduml
